{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-x-xr-replacement-pod","title":"Vaporesso LUXE X Replacement Pod","description":"\u003cdiv\u003eThe Vaporesso Luxe X replacement pods are compatible with the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-x-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe X Kit\"\u003eVaporesso Luxe X,\u003c\/a\u003e Luxe X Pro, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-xr-pod-kit\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe XR Pod Kit\"\u003eLuxe XR\u003c\/a\u003e and Luxe XR Max vape kits. There are several different options to choose from, so no matter whether you prefer a discreet MTL (Mouth To Lung), balanced RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) or loose DTL (Direct To Lung) inhale, Vaporesso has you covered. The built-in coil pods offer more convenience as they require less maintenance, while the empty versions provide more flexibility as they can be paired with the full range of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso Gtx Coils\"\u003eVaporesso GTX coils.\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable 2ml Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Mesh Or Replaceable GTX Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesigned For MTL, RDTL And DTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS Leak-Resistant Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom-Filling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nThe coils built into the Luxe pods feature a mesh build, so they’ll heat e-liquid quickly and evenly for improved flavour. The 0.4 Ohm Luxe X pod will deliver a DTL inhale and works best at 32W – pair it with 70% VG e-liquid for large amounts of vapour. Or, select the 0.8 Ohm Luxe X pod for an MTL vape as this pod works best at 16W and is ideal for 50% VG e-liquid.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"0.4 Ohm Mesh - Two Pack","offer_id":41775215411255,"sku":"V Luxe X Replace Pod - 0.4 ohm - Two Pack","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.6 Ohm Mesh - Two Pack","offer_id":41775215444023,"sku":"V Luxe X Replace Pod - 0.6 ohm - Two Pack","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.8 Ohm Mesh - Two Pack","offer_id":41775215476791,"sku":"V Luxe X Replace Pod - 0.8 ohm - Two Pack","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-luxe-x-replacement-pods-0.8ohm-min.jpg?v=1752512516","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-x-xr-replacement-pod","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




